* Names for the characters that have no printable spelling.
*
* `'A'` says itself, and `'\n'` says itself too -- but a program reads better
* saying `NL` than either, and a tab or an escape has no character to write at
* all. This file is names, and nothing else.

@define NL 10
@define TAB 9
@define SPACE 32
@define ESCAPE 27
